# Semgrep exclusions for vendored / third-party assets that SKIFF
# ships but does not author. Flagging minified libraries as OWASP
# findings is noise — the rule-set is aimed at first-party code.

# xterm.js terminal renderer — vendored at `skiff/static/xterm/`.
# See `skiff/static/xterm/LICENSE` for the upstream MIT licence.
skiff/static/xterm/

# Swagger UI bundle — vendored under `skiff/static/swagger-ui/`.
# Upstream at https://github.com/swagger-api/swagger-ui.
skiff/static/swagger-ui/

# Virtualenvs / build artefacts / caches.
.venv/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
htmlcov/
__pycache__/

# Test fixtures run scanner-tainted inputs on purpose; lint them with
# the unit linters (ruff S-rules, bandit) — semgrep's noisy OWASP
# rule-set flags test-exclusive patterns (subprocess with env kwargs,
# dynamic urllib) that are legitimate in a test harness but would
# be bugs in production code.
tests/

